#: appinstaller.rs:867
msgid "You will be guided through the steps necessary to install this software."
msgstr "Bit ćete vođeni kroz korake potrebne za instalaciju ovog softvera."

#: appinstaller.rs:878
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Verzija"

