msgstr "Formatirati odabrane particije?"

#: installer.rs:1036
msgid "All data on the chosen partitions will be permanently deleted. Other partitions are not changed."
msgstr "Svi podaci na odabranim particijama bit će trajno obrisani. Ostale particije se ne mijenjaju."

#: installer.rs:1037
msgid "Format and Install"
msgstr "Formatiraj i instaliraj"

#: installer.rs:1041
msgid "Install MAN Alongside Windows?"
